  eventId: knock_control_door
  priority: 100
  requiredFlags: []
  blockedFlags: []
  requiredItemUniqueIDs: []
  blockedItemUniqueIDs: []
  dialogues:
  - "The door of control room. The portal room is in it. You have a sense of feeling
    that the truth is behind this door. \nHowever, you don't have enough permission
    to access this room, so you try to knock it."
  - "...\u201Cknock knock\u201D\n...\n...\u201Cknock knock\u201D\n...\n...\nNo response.\n"
  - This shouldn't be the case. Usually there must be someone on duty here.
  - 'Your pager is also broken and cannot be used to contact colleagues. You can
    only receive their messages. Those kinds of situations never happened before.

    Now
    you have to find what happened here by yourself. '
  dialogueAudioSettings:
    bgmOnStart: {fileID: 0}
